In the command window, jump to line start/end and erase words across punctuation,
covering the line-end forward scan and ctlw's non-alphanumeric check.

-- input --
type ab, cd ef
key ctrl-a
key ctrl-e
key ctrl-w
key ctrl-w
key ctrl-w
move 50 5
button 1
button 0
-- waitframes --
29 33 37 41 45 49 53 57 61 65 67 69 75 81 87 87 89 89
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{30}lddxddlddxddlddxddlddxddlddxddlddxddddxddlddxddlddxd{44}
